# OpenClaw 远程只读助手 API

> 统一前缀：`/api/v1/openclaw`。所有接口需要 `X-OpenClaw-Key` header 鉴权。

## 1. 工具列表

### 列出可用工具

```
GET /api/v1/openclaw/tools
```

**Header**: `X-OpenClaw-Key: <your-key>`

**响应**: `ApiResponse<List<OpenClawToolDefinitionVO>>`

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "code": "SUCCESS",
  "data": [
    {
      "name": "quote_snapshot",
      "description": "查询最新价快照",
      "category": "行情数据",
      "requiredParams": [],
      "optionalParams": ["canonicalSymbol", "dataSource", "page", "size"]
    }
  ]
}
```

## 2. 调用工具

```
POST /api/v1/openclaw/tools/{toolName}
```

**Header**: `X-OpenClaw-Key: <your-key>`

**Body**:
```json
{
  "params": {
    "canonicalSymbol": "SH.600519",
    "page": 1,
    "size": 20
  }
}
```

**响应**: `ApiResponse<OpenClawToolResponse>`

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "code": "SUCCESS",
  "data": {
    "toolName": "quote_snapshot",
    "success": true,
    "data": { "items": [...], "total": 5, "page": 1, "size": 20 },
    "timestamp": "2026-07-16T15:00:00"
  }
}
```

## 3. 审计日志

```
GET /api/v1/openclaw/audit?limit=50
```

**响应**: 最近 N 条调用记录（keyHash, toolName, success, durationMs, error, timestamp）

## 4. 错误响应

| HTTP | 原因 |
|------|------|
| 401 | Missing/Invalid API Key |
| 404 | OpenClaw disabled / Unknown tool |
| 429 | Rate limit exceeded |

## 5. 8 类工具参数说明

| 工具 | 必填 | 可选 |
|------|------|------|
| `quote_snapshot` | — | canonicalSymbol, dataSource, page, size |
| `daily_bar` | — | canonicalSymbol, fromDate, toDate, adjustType, dataSource, page, size |
| `minute_bar` | — | canonicalSymbol, intervalType, adjustType, dataSource, fromTime, toTime, tradeDate, page, size |
| `portfolio_summary` | — | — |
| `watchlist` | — | enabled, keyword, tradeStyle |
| `market_alert` | — | resolved, severity, canonicalSymbol, page, size |
| `market_segment` | — | segmentType, enabled, keyword, segmentId, page, size |
| `workbench_overview` | — | — |
